  "changes": [
    "Ten physical non-emissive nonmetallic timber roles distinguish sparse lacquer columns, brown primary beams, warm bracket arms, pale actual cut ends, roof boards, thin brown-red fascia and recessed window parts. The existing independent scan contributes normalized grain once; the material baseColor stays white.",
    "Actual windows now have crossing 90/110 mm muntins, 220 mm frame depth and a recessed brown solid backing. The connected upper descending gallery uses the same timber role system; its separate 191 occupied portal geometry remains unchanged.",
    "Three closed continuous fascia courses, real rafter/tail solids and actual cut ends replace the previous thin segmented lines. R17 reduces the overly bright R15 fascia sections and fixes outward weather-face/downward soffit winding and underside UV order on the existing roof shape.",
    "The existing actual scene-court capture is separated into porch-height and eave-height captures at unit gain, both captured before either is assigned. Single Sun, actual measured sky, camera, exposure and contact AO are held.",
    "R17 replaces the world-up rigid ceramic frame with a frame derived from the actual roof surface normal and longitudinal tangent. Cover radius and pan width track local row spacing, keeping all original closed tile meshes and all ceramic instances."
  ],
